Z||000001||Nashco||11-01-2001||01:07 AM||||Old news; that was the plan pre-German ownership.  The 300M was scheduled to get it the same time as the new Charger R/T, but neither of these plans have realized.  They should have both been put to market, as press releases and everything were going out, claiming this was all going to happen.<P>Apparently the Germans didn't like that idea...because there's been zero talk about it lately.  It's hard to say if anything is for sure in the current rank-and-file, with the recent German "overtaking" of Chrysler.<P>A couple years ago I wanted to work for Dodge/Chrysler very badly....now, as I go through school and the company changes completely, I'm not so sure I want to work for them at all <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||13
